# 界面文本（canvas）。键名为“canvas-”加上取自英文的简短名称，工具提示的键名以 -tip 结尾。

canvas-canvas-is-larger-than-the = 画布超过 GPU 的纹理大小上限
canvas-gpu-initialization-failed = GPU 初始化失败
canvas-gpu-compositing-failed = GPU 合成失败
canvas-gpu-turned-off-in-the = 已在设置中关闭 GPU
canvas-no-gpu-found = 找不到 GPU
canvas-software-gpu-adapter = 这是软件模拟的 GPU
canvas-the-gpu-lacks-the-needed = GPU 缺少所需的功能
canvas-unknown-channel = 项目中没有此通道
canvas-groups-are-nested-too-deeply = 组嵌套层数过深，无法在 GPU 上合成
canvas-over-the-gpu-memory-budget = 超过 GPU 内存上限
canvas-read-only-tip = 只读
canvas-the-view-is-rotated-click-tip = 视图已旋转（{ $angle }）。单击即可重置旋转
canvas-mesh-map-tip = 网格贴图
canvas-stroke-cancelled = 已取消笔画。
canvas-the-view-is-mirrored-click-tip = 视图已左右翻转。单击即可还原
canvas-outside-the-canvas = 在画布之外。
canvas-clone-source-set = 已设置仿制来源。
canvas-layer-set-not-in-the-output = 显示中的图层集未包含在最终输出中
